   "tender": {
    "id": "tender_383903/1284568",
    "title": "PS23280 - Technical evaluation of Security Narrative of the DSIT funded FRANC projects",
    "description": "***** THIS IS AN AWARD NOTICE, NOT A CALL FOR COMPETITION *****\r\n\r\nThis procurement is being concluded following a mini competition under the CCS RM3764 Cyber Security Services 3 DPS.\r\n\r\nBrief Description of Requirement\r\nTo outsource a security insights reporting activity to an independent and external supplier. The security insights of the DSIT Future Networks Programme, FRANC programme.\r\nThis requirement is tightly aligned to the FNP FRANC programme and therefore there is a need to ensure completion of the activity in line with the FRANC programme (see above end date).\r\nTo ensure an accelerated activity, the supplier should have proven experience with the telecom cyber security aspects of the DSIT FNP FRANC Programme and the resources to manage the activity within the mentioned time frames.",
